  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MK institutional cooperation Statistics (pre-study, SCB) - MK Institutional cooperation statistics, pre-study (SCB)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MK myndighetssamarbete statistik</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">In light of the re-opened bilateral development cooperation between Sweden and Macedonia, the Macedonian Statistical Office expressed interest in continuing cooperation with Statistics Sweden, SCB. In order to investigate the conditions for the cooperation, to update SCB&#x2019;s knowledge of context, current partner capacity and needs, as well as define furure coopertion areas, SCB together with their counterpart SSO was expected to conduct a feasibility study. The study was expected to result in a proposal for continued cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In light of the re-opened bilateral development cooperation between Sweden and Macedonia, the Macedonian Statistical Office expressed interest in continuing cooperation with Statistics Sweden, SCB. In order to investigate the conditions for the cooperation, to update SCB&#x2019;s knowledge of context, current partner capacity and needs, as well as define furure coopertion areas, SCB together with their counterpart SSO will conduct a feasibility study. The study covers about six months, including two visits to MK and should result in a proposal for continued cooperation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mot bakgrund av det &#xe5;terupptagna bilaterala utvecklingssamarbetet mellan Sverige och Makedonien har den makedonska statistikmyndigheten uttryckt intresse av att forts&#xe4;tta samarbetet med SCB. I syfte att utreda f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r detta, uppdatera kunskap om kontexten, samarbetspartnerns nuvarande kapacitet och behov, samt definiera framtida samarbetsomr&#xe5;den ska SCB, tillsammans med sin motpart SSO, genomf&#xf6;ra en f&#xf6;rstudie. F&#xf6;rstudien, som f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas p&#xe5;g&#xe5; ett drygt halv&#xe5;r, inkluderar tv&#xe5; bes&#xf6;ksresor till MK och avses resultera i ett f&#xf6;rslag till samarbetsprojekt.</narrative>
  </description>
